& [CanonicalRecord: IR4FinalSlices] is the processed planning authority for IR4 final work slices
  + [canonical_uuid] is 064a7937-6fb0-4250-9dd8-7c70bf0fc134
  + [source_manifest_uuid] is 2c4acfb3-cb68-4738-80a6-f1959d213dc6
  + [slice_surface_uuid] is 5f3b11f1-5e6f-4adc-8b71-fdc055ec3678
  + [authority_scope] is IR4 slice order, gates, expected outputs, model routing, LangGraph runtime boundary, checkpoint non-authority policy, SOP-first interrupt policy, runtime trace fixture planning, implementation activation boundary, and forbidden live operations scope
  + [implementation_scope] is runtime graph planning plus gated implementation activation
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/FSC3_Runtime_Graph_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/runtime/WholeFieldPlannerGraph_Contract.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/runtime/SOP_First_Interrupt_Resume_Contract.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/runtime/Operator_Trace_Runtime_Proof_Contract.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/planning/IR3_Operator_Harness_Implementation_Proof_Pack.v1.sop
  + [depends_on] is docs/reviews/IR3_Implementation_Completion_Review.v1.sop

  = must: use docs/slices/IR4_Final_Slices.v1.sop as the current IR4 slice surface
  = must: execute IR4-S01 first
  = must: run completion review after each IR4 slice before opening the next gated slice
  = must: keep LangGraph checkpoint state, graph state, generated traces, generated reports, and fixture outputs non-authoritative
  - never: treat IR4 slices as permission for dependency installation, surface implementation, adapter implementation, operations simulator implementation, operations control, or live machine control

& [CanonicalIR4SliceSet] is the final IR4 slice sequence
  + [slice] is IR4-S01 runtime boundary import and invariant reconciliation
  + [slice] is IR4-S02 WholeFieldPlannerGraph implementation contract and node mapping
  + [slice] is IR4-S03 checkpoint and SOP-first interrupt policy
  + [slice] is IR4-S04 runtime graph fixture plan and expected trace ledger plan
  + [slice] is IR4-S05 LangGraph proof runtime implementation plan and dependency boundary
  + [slice] is IR4-S06 IR4 completion review and implementation activation pack

  = must: preserve this order unless completion review rebakes IR4

& [CanonicalIR4ExecutionGate] is the activation rule for IR4
  + [current_ready_slice] is IR4-S01
  + [gated_slice] is IR4-S02 until IR4-S01 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR4-S03 until IR4-S02 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR4-S04 until IR4-S03 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR4-S05 until IR4-S04 accepted
  + [gated_slice] is IR4-S06 until IR4-S05 accepted
  + [completion_gate] is IR4 implementation activation pack accepted after IR4-S06

& [CanonicalIR4ModelRouting] is the model-routing record
  + [IR4-S01] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR4-S02] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR4-S03] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR4-S04] is GPT-5.3-Codex-Spark-suitable after IR4-S01 through IR4-S03 are accepted and fixture scope is bounded
  + [IR4-S05] is requires deeper reasoning
  + [IR4-S06] is requires deeper reasoning

  = must: keep graph authority boundaries, checkpoint semantics, interrupt semantics, and final activation under deeper reasoning

